{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Agent Traces Logs and Metrics.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Agent Traces Logs and Metrics.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"agent traces logs and metrics agent traces logs and metrics","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Agent Traces Logs and Metrics.md","fileName":"Agent Traces Logs and Metrics.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Agent Traces Logs and Metrics","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 12:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI Agent Observability and Evaluation]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Agent Observability and Evaluation","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Agent Traces Logs and Metrics.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Agent Traces Logs and Metrics.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"agent traces logs and metrics agent traces logs and metrics","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Agent Traces Logs and Metrics.md","fileName":"Agent Traces Logs and Metrics.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Agent Traces Logs and Metrics","heading":"Agent Traces Logs and Metrics","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Agent observability uses traces, logs, and metrics for different views of behavior. Traces connect the agent run to model calls, tool invocations, retries, fallbacks, and failures. Logs record structured events, correlation identifiers, policy decisions, and guardrail outcomes. Metrics summarize request rate, latency, tokens, tool errors, completion, and evaluation passes.\n\nTogether, these signals reveal both the execution path and aggregate trends. Capturing only the final text loses the evidence needed to debug why an agent selected a tool, retried a call, or crossed a quality threshold.","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Agent Observability and Evaluation","agenticaiforde